Dialogue: 7,0:00:46.87,0:00:51.28,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}我比谁都更加爱着你
Dialogue: 7,0:00:51.28,0:00:56.74,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur10}就连悲伤都可以跨越
Dialogue: 7,0:00:57.33,0:00:59.13,OP - CN - 2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}{\blur10\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK_中\3c&HF0BF3C&}Sunday  morning
